    "body": "Bumping the schema `$id` to `v0.2` will change resolver behavior that rewrites `$schema` URIs to include the version prefix. Please make sure all in-repo consumers that assert/assume `v0.1/csr_schema.json#` are updated accordingly (e.g., `tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_yaml_resolver.rb` has hard-coded `v0.1/csr_schema.json#` expectations, and the schema versioning READMEs list `0.1 (current)`).\n",
